// Theses (Bachelor's and Master's) require at least one of the two (Leitfaden, Section 3.5). Enable them in main.typ
// via `show-abstract` and `show-management-summary`. Neither counts towards the word count of the thesis. In draft mode
// (`draft: true` in main.typ), a note appears below the text if it is too long.

// Abstract: aimed at a scientific audience, max. half a page (250 words)
#let abstract = [
  Hier steht das Abstract der Arbeit.
]

// Management Summary: practice-oriented, max. one page (500 words)
#let management-summary = [
  Hier steht die Management Summary der Arbeit.
]
